--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1 +1,27 @@
 # boxoffice — an event-ticketing JSON API
+
+A small JSON API for selling tickets: events, expiring seat holds, purchases,
+partial refunds and idempotent retries. PHP 8.5 with SQLite (PDO), no dependencies.
+
+## Run
+
+```
+BOXOFFICE_DB=var/boxoffice.sqlite php -S 127.0.0.1:8080 -t public public/index.php
+```
+
+Send `X-Clock: 2026-05-01T10:00:00Z` to pin "now" for a request (handy for tests).
+
+## Test
+
+```
+php tests/run.php
+```
+
+## Layout
+
+- `public/index.php` — front controller
+- `src/Http/` — request, response, router, HTTP errors
+- `src/Validator.php`, `src/Clock.php` — input validation and timestamps
+- `src/Database.php`, `src/Repository.php` — SQLite schema and queries
+- `src/Ticketing.php` — availability, holds, purchases, refunds
+- `src/Idempotency.php` — `Idempotency-Key` storage and replay
